# Logs that only grow: every instance of the stack (another folder, another laptop) adds lines to
# both, so a merge keeps every side's lines instead of stopping on a conflict.
#   metrics/ledger.jsonl — one JSON event per line; scripts/metrics.py drops any line a union merge
#                          doubles, and re-sorts by time, so order after a merge does not matter.
#   CHANGELOG.md         — one-line entries prepended by scripts/changelog.sh; two merged entries both
#                          stay at the top, in either order.
# METRICS.md is not listed: on a conflict, take either side and re-run `scripts/metrics.sh render`.
metrics/ledger.jsonl merge=union
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
